// Copy to Local.xcconfig (ignored by git) and fill in.
// Circle client key for Modular Wallets: public by design (a client key, not
// an API key). It must be an iOS client key, created in the Circle Console for
// the bundle ID com.enzoblain.ardoise, with ardoise-rust.vercel.app as its
// passkey domain: the web app's key (an allowed domain, no bundle ID) is
// refused with a 401, since the SDK sends the app's bundle ID.
// xcconfig reads "//" as a comment, so write the key as is (it has no "//").
CIRCLE_CLIENT_KEY =
